{#
  BeMart admin Page edit — EC-CUBE goPage (ページ登録/編集).

  PORT of EC-CUBE 4.3 admin-theme `Content/page_edit.twig`
  (src/Eccube/Resource/template/admin/Content/page_edit.twig).

  FORM/CRUD page. Extends the admin frame (`admin-base.html.twig`). The
  markup skeleton + `c-*` / `ec-*` / Bootstrap classes are kept verbatim
  from EC-CUBE; only the dynamic bindings are rebound.

  FORM-PAGE recipe (Ray.WebFormModule — see var/templates/README.md): the
  Page resource (src/Resource/Page/Admin/Page/Page.php) exposes an
  {@see \MyVendor\BeMart\Form\AdminPageForm} as `body['form']`, pre-filled
  with the persisted row. The inputs render through that real form object:
    {{ form.input('name')|raw }}      <- real <input> w/ id/attrs/value
    {{ form.error('name') }}          <- inline Be-domain error, if any
  `AdminPageForm::init()` ports the field names / ids from EC-CUBE's
  `MainEditType` (block prefix `main_edit`).

  EC-CUBE-ism rebinding (see var/templates/README.md, "Admin pages"):
   - `{{ 'key'|trans }}`  -> the ja literal from messages.ja.yaml.
   - `url(route)`         -> deterministic `/{route}` (BeMartTwigExtension).
   - `form_widget(form._token)` -> EC-CUBE per-request CSRF widget. The
     hidden `_token` input is kept (structure) with an empty value;
     EC-CUBE-runtime only — enumerated as residual.
   - `is_user_data_page` -> the seed page is a SYSTEM page (pageEditType
     2 = EDIT_TYPE_DEFAULT), so the `{% else %}` (non-user-data) branch
     is rendered: the URL / file-name show as a static label + hidden
     input. The user-data-page branch is dropped.
   - `is_confirm_page` -> false; the layout-設定 + meta-設定 cards render.
   - `form_widget(form.PcLayout)` / `form_widget(form.SpLayout)` -> the
     PC / Mobile layout selects. The AdminPageFetched projection carries
     no page->layout join (out of the Wave 9 CMS slice), so the
     AdminPageForm declares no PcLayout/SpLayout fields and those select
     cells render empty. Enumerated as residual — MISSING-BODY-FIELD:
     `Page.PcLayout` / `Page.SpLayout`.
   - the ACE editor `tpl_data` source + the meta fields — the free-page
     template body + page meta were out of the Wave 9 CMS slice, so the
     editor + meta inputs render empty (the AdminPageForm fields have no
     persisted value). The markup shells are kept.
   - `{% form_theme %}` and the `auto_render` entity-extension loop ->
     Symfony form-theme / EC-CUBE entity-extension runtime. Dropped.
#}
{% extends 'admin-base.html.twig' %}

{% set route = 'admin_content_page_edit' %}
{% set title = 'ページ管理' %}
{% set sub_title = 'コンテンツ管理' %}

{% block stylesheet %}
    <style>
        .ui-resizable-se {
            right: -3px;
            bottom: -3px;
        }
    </style>
{% endblock %}

{% block javascript %}
    <script>
        ace.require('ace/ext/language_tools');
        var editor = ace.edit('editor');
        editor.session.setMode('ace/mode/twig');
        editor.setTheme('ace/theme/tomorrow');
        editor.setValue('{{ pageTplData|default('')|escape('js') }}');
        editor.setOptions({
            enableBasicAutocompletion: true,
            enableSnippets: true,
            enableLiveAutocompletion: true,
            showInvisibles: true
        });

        $("#editor").resizable({
            resize: function (event, ui) {
                editor.resize();
            }
        });

        $('#content_page_form').on('submit', function(elem) {
            $('#main_edit_tpl_data').val(editor.getValue());
        });
    </script>
{% endblock %}

{% block main %}
    <form id="content_page_form" method="post"
          action="{{ pageId|default('') ? url('admin_content_page_edit', {id: pageId}) : url('admin_content_page_new') }}">
        <input type="hidden" id="main_edit__token" name="_token" value="{{ csrfToken|default('') }}">

        <div class="c-contentsArea__cols">
            <div class="c-contentsArea__primaryCol">
                <div class="c-primaryCol">
                    <!-- ページ設定 -->
                    <div class="card rounded border-0 mb-4">
                        <div class="card-header">
                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-8"><span class="card-title">ページ設定</span></div>
                                <div class="col-4 text-end">
                                    <a data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#pageDetail" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="pageDetail">
                                        <i class="fa fa-angle-up fa-lg"></i>
                                    </a>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="collapse show ec-cardCollapse" id="pageDetail">
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <!-- ページ名 -->
                                <div class="row mb-2">
                                    <div class="col-2">
                                        <span>ページ名</span>
                                        <span class="badge bg-primary ms-1">必須</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-10">
                                        {{ form.input('name')|raw }}
                                        {% if form.error('name') %}<span class="invalid-feedback d-block">{{ form.error('name') }}</span>{% endif %}
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <!-- URL -->
                                <div class="row mb-2">
                                    <div class="col-2">
                                        <span>URL</span>
                                        <span class="badge bg-primary ms-1">必須</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-10">
                                        <div class="row">
                                            <div class="col pe-0"><span class="align-middle">{{ pageUrl|default('') }}</span></div>
                                            <div>{{ form.input('url')|raw }}</div>
                                            {% if form.error('url') %}<span class="invalid-feedback d-block">{{ form.error('url') }}</span>{% endif %}
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <!-- ファイル名 -->
                                <div class="row mb-2">
                                    <div class="col-2">
                                        <div class="d-inline-block" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="ページの内容を記述したtwigテンプレートファイルの名前です。">
                                            <span>ファイル名</span><i class="fa fa-question-circle fa-lg ms-1"></i>
                                        </div>
                                        <span class="badge bg-primary ms-1">必須</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-10">
                                        <div class="row">
                                            <div class="col pe-0 align-middle">
                                                <span class="align-middle">{{ pageFileName|default('') }}.twig</span>
                                                <div>{{ form.input('file_name')|raw }}</div>
                                            </div>
                                            {% if form.error('file_name') %}<span class="invalid-feedback d-block">{{ form.error('file_name') }}</span>{% endif %}
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <!-- コード -->
                                <div class="row mb-2">
                                    <div class="col-2">
                                        <div class="d-inline-block" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="テンプレートファイルを編集します。twigで記述します。">
                                            <span>コード</span><i class="fa fa-question-circle fa-lg ms-1"></i>
                                        </div>
                                        <span class="badge bg-primary ms-1">必須</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-10">
                                        <div id="editor" style="height: 480px" class="form-control"></div>
                                        <div style="display: none">{{ form.input('tpl_data')|raw }}</div>
                                        {% if form.error('tpl_data') %}<span class="invalid-feedback d-block">{{ form.error('tpl_data') }}</span>{% endif %}
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div> <!-- レイアウト設定 -->
                    <div class="card rounded border-0 mb-4">
                        <div class="card-header">
                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-8">
                                    <div class="d-inline-block" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top"
                                         title="このページに適用するレイアウトを選択します。">
                                        <span class="card-title">
                                            レイアウト設定
                                            <i class="fa fa-question-circle fa-lg ms-1"></i>
                                        </span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-4 text-end">
                                    <a data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#pageLayout" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="pageLayout">
                                        <i class="fa fa-angle-up fa-lg"></i>
                                    </a>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="collapse show ec-cardCollapse" id="pageLayout">
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <!-- PC -->
                                <div class="row mb-2">
                                    <div class="col-2"><span>PC</span></div>
                                    <div class="col-10">
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <!-- モバイル -->
                                <div class="row mb-2">
                                    <div class="col-2"><span>モバイル</span></div>
                                    <div class="col-10">
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <!-- メタ設定 -->
                    <div class="card rounded border-0 mb-4">
                        <div class="card-header">
                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-8">
                                    <div class="d-inline-block" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="ページのMETAタグの内容を指定できます。">
                                        <span class="card-title">メタ設定</span>
                                        <i class="fa fa-question-circle fa-lg ms-1"></i>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-4 text-end">
                                    <a data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#pageMeta" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="pageMeta">
                                        <i class="fa fa-angle-up fa-lg"></i>
                                    </a>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="collapse show ec-cardCollapse" id="pageMeta">
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <!-- author -->
                                <div class="row mb-2">
                                    <div class="col-2"><span>author</span></div>
                                    <div class="col-10">
                                        {{ form.input('author')|raw }}
                                        {% if form.error('author') %}<span class="invalid-feedback d-block">{{ form.error('author') }}</span>{% endif %}
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <!-- description -->
                                <div class="row mb-2">
                                    <div class="col-2"><span>description</span></div>
                                    <div class="col-10">
                                        {{ form.input('description')|raw }}
                                        {% if form.error('description') %}<span class="invalid-feedback d-block">{{ form.error('description') }}</span>{% endif %}
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <!-- keyword -->
                                <div class="row mb-2">
                                    <div class="col-2"><span>keyword</span></div>
                                    <div class="col-10">
                                        {{ form.input('keyword')|raw }}
                                        {% if form.error('keyword') %}<span class="invalid-feedback d-block">{{ form.error('keyword') }}</span>{% endif %}
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <!-- robot -->
                                <div class="row mb-2">
                                    <div class="col-2"><span>robot</span></div>
                                    <div class="col-10">
                                        {{ form.input('meta_robots')|raw }}
                                        {% if form.error('meta_robots') %}<span class="invalid-feedback d-block">{{ form.error('meta_robots') }}</span>{% endif %}
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <!-- metatag -->
                                <div class="row">
                                    <div class="col-2">
                                        <div class="d-inline-block" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="METAタグの出力をカスタマイズできます。twig内で利用されている変数も利用可能です。空欄の場合は、テンプレートフォルダの meta.twig ファイルが読み込まれます。">
                                            <span>metatag</span>
                                            <i class="fa fa-question-circle fa-lg ms-1"></i>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-10">
                                        {{ form.input('meta_tags')|raw }}
                                        {% if form.error('meta_tags') %}<span class="invalid-feedback d-block">{{ form.error('meta_tags') }}</span>{% endif %}
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="c-conversionArea">
            <div class="c-conversionArea__container">
                <div class="row justify-content-between align-items-center">
                    <div class="col-6">
                        <div class="c-conversionArea__leftBlockItem">
                            <a class="c-baseLink" href="{{ url('admin_content_page') }}">
                                <i class="fa fa-backward" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                <span>ページ管理</span>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-6">
                        <div id="ex-conversion-action" class="row align-items-center justify-content-end">
                            <div class="col-auto">
                                <button class="btn btn-ec-conversion px-5" type="submit">登録</button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </form>

    {% if message is defined and message %}
        <p class="ec-errorMessage">{{ message }}</p>
    {% endif %}
{% endblock %}
